LAMMPS (22 Jul 2025 - Update 3)
OMP_NUM_THREADS environment is not set. Defaulting to 1 thread.
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task

clear
OMP_NUM_THREADS environment is not set. Defaulting to 1 thread.
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic

shell cd ./NbMo_Nb0

variable data_file string "lattice_constant_alloy.lmp"
variable potential_file string "potential.inp"
variable thermo_time equal 100
variable dump_time equal 1000


read_data ${data_file}
read_data lattice_constant_alloy.lmp
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (31.6 31.6 31.6)
  1 by 2 by 2 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  2000 atoms
  read_data CPU = 0.009 seconds

include ${potential_file}
include potential.inp
pair_style mlip ../potential_repository/NbMo.mtp
pair_coeff * *

compute peratom all pe/atom
compute pe all pe

thermo_style custom step temp pe vol lx ly lz press pxx pyy pzz fnorm
thermo_modify format float %5.5g
thermo ${thermo_time}
thermo 100

shell mkdir dump_lattice_constant

reset_timestep 0
dump first_dump all custom 1 dump.lattice.initial.0 id type x y z c_peratom
run 0
WARNING: No fixes with time integration, atoms won't move
